  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Saving Grauers gorillas in community forests through direct protection, community engagement and establishing formally recognized forest concessions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To ensure the survival of gorillas in community owned forest through direct protection, we will seek to: add 300km2 to the Nkuba Research and Conservation area, expand community engagement activities to address critical nutritional and food security needs: continue ongoing collaboration between Nkuba community and ICCN.</narrative>
  </description>
